      "en": "Ferries from Las Palmas to Morro Jable (about 2 h) and from Corralejo to Playa Blanca on Lanzarote (about 30 min, hourly). On Lanzarote and in inland Gran Canaria (Roque Nublo, Tejeda) a car helps a lot: Timanfaya has no bus. From Órzola, in the north of Lanzarote, a boat to La Graciosa makes a day trip."
